# Data & results (never commit data; adapters download with checksums)
# Root-anchored: bare "data/" would also match src/volbench/data/ (source code).
#
# By LOCATION, never by file type. There used to be a blanket `*.parquet` here,
# and it had the wrong shape: tests/test_licensing_guard.py is deliberately
# built on location precisely so that no per-file judgement is ever needed, and
# a type-based ignore reintroduces exactly that judgement — while silently
# withholding evidence that belongs beside the document it supports
# (docs/P3_CONVERGENCE_FITS.parquet). Everything a study writes goes under
# /data/ or results/, so those two rules already cover every parquet that must
# never be committed; a parquet anywhere else is now visible rather than hidden,
# and whether it may be committed is decided by reading its columns.
/data/
results/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
